starhermit-webp is written from RFC 9649 (WebP) and RFC 6386 (VP8). Its VP8
constant tables (coefficient and mode probabilities, dequantization
factors) are those RFC 6386 publishes with Google's VP8 reference decoder,
the same as in libvpx and libwebp, and its RGB conversion, chroma
upsampling, animation blending and handling of data no encoder writes
follow libwebp, the WebP reference implementation. These are distributed
under the notice below, which applies to starhermit-webp and must
accompany any distribution of software that includes it, in source or
binary form. This notice concerns copyright only.

